        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_02",
      "hash64": "160D28AC1FC18902",
      "text": "In my last class, I taught about HP restoration.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_03",
      "hash64": "160D29AC1FC18AB5",
      "text": "However, after class, I was asked by several of\\nyou about [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Power Points[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], commonly known as [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]PP[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_04",
      "hash64": "160D22AC1FC17ED0",
      "text": "When a Pokémon loses all of its HP, it faints and\\ncan no longer battle![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_05",
      "hash64": "160D23AC1FC18083",
      "text": "What, then, happens to a Pokémon when it loses\\nall of its PP?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "DB0694D3DE259316",
      "text": "It can’t use moves",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "DB0693D3DE259163",
      "text": "It won’t listen to its Trainer",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "DB0692D3DE258FB0",
      "text": "All of its stats get lowered",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "8EEEDB593E4FB2B8",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Perfectly correct, M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\r\\nPerhaps\\r\\nyou\\r\\nknow\\r\\nthis\\r\\nfrom\\r\\nfirsthand experience?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
