    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "8EEEDE593E4FB7D1",
      "text": "That would certainly be a dangerous situation,\\nbut that is not the correct answer.\\c\\nWhether a Pokémon listens to its Trainer depends\\non the number of Gym Badges the Trainer has.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "8EEEDD593E4FB61E",
      "text": "That would certainly be a dangerous situation,\\nbut that is not the correct answer.\\c\\nThat is not the sort of power we are talking\\nabout when we talk of Power Points.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 166,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_06",
      "hash64": "160D24AC1FC18236",
      "text": "When a Pokémon runs out of PP, it can no longer\\nuse its moves.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_07",
      "hash64": "160D25AC1FC183E9",
      "text": "However, each move has its own store of PP, so\\nyou can mitigate PP loss by using a variety of\\r\\nmoves rather than just one move repeatedly.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_08",
      "hash64": "160D2EAC1FC19334",
      "text": "If a Pokémon loses all PP for all of its moves, it\\nwill only be able to use Struggle—an action that\\r\\nalso damages the Pokémon that uses it.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_09",
      "hash64": "160D2FAC1FC194E7",
      "text": "In order to avoid this predicament, PP can be\\nrestored at Pokémon Centers along with HP.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_10",
      "hash64": "16102CAC1FC3C5A5",
      "text": "Items such as Ethers and Max Ethers can also be\\nused to restore PP. Be careful not to confuse\\r\\nPotions with Ethers in the heat of battle![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_11",
      "hash64": "16102BAC1FC3C3F2",
      "text": "However, Ethers are not sold at shops, so you\\nshould use them judiciously if you find them.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_12",
      "hash64": "16102AAC1FC3C23F",
      "text": "The stronger the move, the lower its maximum PP.\\c\\nDo not waste uses of these moves unless you wish\\nto quickly run out of PP. It is important to find\\r\\nbalance in a Pokémon’s set of moves.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_13",
      "hash64": "161029AC1FC3C08C",
      "text": "As you can see, HP isn’t the only thing you must\\nkeep an eye on while adventuring with Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_14",
      "hash64": "161028AC1FC3BED9",
      "text": "I hope that you will all take care to ensure that\\nyour partner Pokémon can perform at their best\\r\\nas you each engage in the Treasure Hunt.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_15",
      "hash64": "161027AC1FC3BD26",
      "text": "Our time together has come to an end for today.\\nOur next meeting will be an examination day.\\r\\nBe sure to review well in preparation.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
